.TH STOP-MU2EDAQ-RUNLOG-DB.SH 1 "2026-10-06" "mu2edaq-runlog-db t01.00.00" "Mu2e DAQ Manual"
.SH NAME
stop-mu2edaq-runlog-db.sh \- control-room stop wrapper for the run-log viewer
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B stop\-mu2edaq\-runlog\-db.sh
.SH DESCRIPTION
Standardised Mu2e control-room stop script, run by
.BR "crs-app stop runlog-db" .
It
.BR exec s
.BR stop\-mu2e\-rundb\-viewer (1)
with any arguments.
A regular file, not a symbolic link.
.SH OPTIONS
None.
.SH EXIT STATUS
That of
.BR stop\-mu2e\-rundb\-viewer (1).
.SH EXAMPLES
.RS
.nf
\&./stop\-mu2edaq\-runlog\-db.sh
.fi
.RE
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR start\-mu2edaq\-runlog\-db.sh (1),
.BR stop\-mu2e\-rundb\-viewer (1)
.SH AUTHOR
Mu2e DAQ group, Fermilab.
